<title>UK: LME copper quiet, aluminium holds above $1,600.</title>
<headline>LME copper quiet, aluminium holds above $1,600.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Barely changed, lacking impetus. Cash/threes back at $65/68.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM  - Holding above $1,600, but off early highs.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Softer, struggling with $7,300 level.</p>
<p>ZINC - Just easier.  LEAD - Stable.</p>
<p>TIN - Quiet, bid below $5,700.</p>
</text>
